title: Inter-Party Relationships
new-page: true
view-if: inter_party_relationships_timer <= 0
tags: party_affairs
is-card: true
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; inter_party_relationships_timer = 6;
card-image: img/rrgreen.jpg
#subtitle: Building relations with the other political parties of Germany.

= Inter-Party Relationships

What parties should we improve our relations with?

- @rel_greens: Strengthen our ties with the <span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">**Greens**</span> by moderating our foreign policy stance.
- @rel_spd: Strengthen our ties with the <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">**SPD**</span> by moderating our economic policy stance.
- @rel_bsw: Improve our ties with our splinter party, the <span style="color: [+ bsw_color +];">**BSW**</span>, by moderating our socially progressive stances.
- @rel_cdu: Approach the <span style="color: [+ cdu_color +];">**CDU**</span>.
- @linke_alone: The <span style="color: [+ linke_color +];">**Left**</span> can stand alone for now.
- @easy_discard

@rel_greens
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; foreign_moderation += 1; greens_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); emali_strength += 1; pragmatist_strength += 1; oldleft_dissent += 2; pragmatist_dissent -= 1; wagenknecht_left_progress += 1;

We have improved our relations with the <span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">**Greens**</span>.

@rel_spd
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; econ_moderation += 1; spd_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); emali_strength += 1; pragmatist_strength += 2; beweli_dissent += 2; oldleft_dissent += 1; pragmatist_dissent -= 2;

We have improved our relations with the <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">**SPD**</span>.

@rel_bsw
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: bsw_split
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; social_moderation += 1; bsw_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); oldleft_strength += 2; oldleft_dissent -= 2; pragmatist_dissent += 2; beweli_dissent += 1;

We have improved our relations with the <span style="color: [+ bsw_color +];">**BSW**</span>.

@rel_cdu
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; foreign_moderation += 1; social_moderation += 1; econ_moderation += 1; cdu_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); beweli_dissent += 4; pragmatist_strength += 3; oldleft_dissent += 1; pragmatist_dissent -= 1; emali_dissent += 1; wagenknecht_left_progress += 1;

We have improved our relations with the <span style="color: [+ cdu_color +];">**CDU**</span>.

@linke_alone
on-arrival: greens_relation -= 1; spd_relation -= 1; beweli_strength += 1;

Whether it is because we *cannot* or *will not*, we do not make ties with other parties at this moment.

- @return: Continue...
